      },
      "value": "This is to formally confirm that \na British national holding passport number UK123456789, was employed by Pinnacle Tech Enterprises from 1 April 2019 to 30 September 2024. He held the position of Lead Software Engineer during her tenure.",
      "autoScale": false
    },
    {
