        "fontFamily": "Gothic A1, sans-serif",
        "fontWeight": 300,
        "textDecoration": "none"
      },
      "value": "His key responsibilities included:\n- Leading software development teams on innovative product launches\n- Overseeing the design and implementation of scalable systems\n- Collaborating with cross-functional departments to deliver cutting-edge solutions",
      "autoScale": false
    },
    {
